# Declares system user/group that owns Hyperuplink's runtime data and reads
# its config.
#
# Shipping this under /usr/lib/sysusers.d makes rpm generate the
# `Provides: user(hyperuplink)` / `group(hyperuplink)` that satisfy the
# ownership dependencies rpm derives from the packaged files, and lets
# systemd-sysusers (re)create the account.
#
# The package's %pre scriptlet also creates it directly so it exists before the
# payload is unpacked.
#
#Type Name        ID GECOS                 Home                Shell
g     hyperuplink -
u     hyperuplink -  "Hyperuplink service" /var/lib/hyperuplink /usr/sbin/nologin
